spans.s:
(rather a Nom. शब्दय fr. शब्द) cl. 10. P. (Dhātup. xxxiii, 40) शब्दयति, to make any noise or sound, cry aloud, Śiś.; Pañcat.; BhP.;
to call, invoke, Śaṃk.; Kathās.;
 (शब्दापयति, ˚ते), to call, address, R. :
Pass. श॑ब्द्यते, to be sounded &c.;
to be called, MBh.;
 (impers.) it is chattered, Nir. i, 18.
